  "body": "\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><span><ruby>카<rt>ˍ</rt></ruby>닿<ruby>챠<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby></span></h2>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-4-3 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/AFc8X6s0JSo?version=3&amp;rel=1&amp;showsearch=0&amp;showinfo=1&amp;iv_load_policy=1&amp;fs=1&amp;hl=en&amp;autohide=2&amp;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span>\n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">漢諺混寫 Hanri-Hangul mixed script</h3>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>踅<rt>셓ˆ</rt></ruby>’래 <ruby>踅<rt>셓ˆ</rt></ruby>’킈 <ruby title=\"khia\">騎<rt>캬-</rt></ruby><ruby>꾼<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby title=\"khā-tah-chiâ\">跤踏車<rt>카ˉ닿챠ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    sêh’lai sêh’khi khia-gùn’e khā-tah-chiâ\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby title=\"tân-thai\">等待<rt>단ˆ태-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>下課<rt>하코</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    tân-thai-lì ha-kho\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby title=\"pue\">陪<rt>붸-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>每工<rt>뮈ˆ강ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>做陣<rt>죄ˋ딘-</rt></ruby><ruby>行<rt>걀ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    pue-lì mûi-kâng joè-tin-kiá̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby title=\"khīn-khīn\">輕輕<rt>킨ˉ킨ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>心內<rt>심ˉ래-</rt></ruby><ruby title=\"wē\">話<rt>웨ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby title=\"phoā̰\">伴<rt>퐐ˉ</rt></ruby>’됴 <ruby>車輦<rt>챠ˉ롄ˋ</rt></ruby><a href=\"#_ftn1\" id=\"_ftnref1\"><strong>¹</strong></a> <ruby>跤踏<rt>카ˉ닿-</rt></ruby><ruby title=\"siâ̰\">聲<rt>샬ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    khīn-khīn-sīm-lai-wē phoā̰’tio chiā-lièn khā-tah-siâ̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>꾼<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby title=\"hī-bāng\">希望<rt>히ˉ빵ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>攏<rt>렁ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>寄<rt>갸ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>佇<rt>듸-</rt></ruby><ruby>햐<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    gùn’e hī-bāng lông-kià-ti-hiâ\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>樹頂<rt>츄뎽ˋ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>鳥仔<rt>ᄌᆤˆ아ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>不時<rt>붇ˆ시-</rt></ruby><ruby title=\"lai\">來<rt>래-</rt></ruby><ruby>偷聽<rt>ᄐᅷˉ턀ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    chiu-tièng’e jiâu-à pût-si-lai-thāu-thiâ̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby title=\"thiā̰\">聽<rt>턀ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>란<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>談<rt>담-</rt></ruby><ruby>戀愛<rt>롼애</rt></ruby> <ruby title=\"khoài-lork\">快樂<rt>쾌ˋ럭-</rt></ruby><ruby>約會<rt>역ˆ훼ˉ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>心情<rt>심ˉ쟐ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    thiā̰-làn tam-loan-ai khoài-lork-yôrk-huē’e sīm-jiá̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>꾼<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>純情<rt>순졩-</rt></ruby><ruby title=\"bāng\">夢<rt>빵ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby title=\"wi\">為<rt>위-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby title=\"mûi-kâng\">每工<rt>뮈ˆ강ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>囥<rt>킁ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>佇<rt>듸-</rt></ruby><ruby>쟈<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    gùn’e sun-jieng-bāng wi-lì mûi-kâng khǹg-ti-jiâ\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>歡歡喜喜<rt>활ˉ활ˉ히ˆ히ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>陪<rt>붸-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>做陣<rt>죄ˋ딘-</rt></ruby><ruby>行<rt>걀ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    hoā̰-hoā̰-hî-hì pue-lì joè-tin-kiá̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby title=\"sêh\">踅<rt>셓ˆ</rt></ruby>’앟 <ruby title=\"sêh\">踅<rt>셓ˆ</rt></ruby>’앟 <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby title=\"sêh\">踅<rt>셓ˆ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby title=\"sêh\">踅<rt>셓ˆ</rt></ruby>’됴 <ruby>란<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby title=\"ai\">愛<rt>애</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    sêh’ah sêh’ah sêh, sêh’tio làn’e ai\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby title=\"tâh\">踏<rt>닿ˆ</rt></ruby>’<ruby>아<rt>ˍ</rt></ruby> <ruby title=\"tâh\">踏<rt>닿ˆ</rt></ruby>’<ruby>아<rt>ˍ</rt></ruby> <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby title=\"tâh\">踏<rt>닿ˆ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby title=\"tâh\">踏<rt>닿ˆ</rt></ruby>’됴 <ruby title=\"chiēng-chûn\">青春<rt>촁ˉ춘ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>佮<rt>갛ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>期待<rt>기태ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    tâh’ā tâh’ā tâh, tâh’tio chiēng-chûn kâh-ki-thāi\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby title=\"tḭ̄-bît\">甜蜜<rt>딜ˉ삗ˆ</rt></ruby>’에 <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby title=\"jū-bī\">滋味<rt>주ˉ삐ˉ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby title=\"châm\">摻<rt>참ˆ</rt></ruby>’됴 <ruby>란<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby title=\"ai\">愛<rt>애</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    tḭ̄-bît’e jū-bī, châm’tio làn’e ai\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>꾼<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>會<rt>에-</rt></ruby><ruby title=\"yêng-oân\">永遠<rt>옝ˆ완ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby title=\"khǹg\">囥<rt>킁ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby title=\"jai\">在<rt>재-</rt></ruby><ruby title=\"sīm-lāi\">心內<rt>심ˉ래ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    gùn e-yêng-oân-khǹg-jai-sīm-lāi\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>踅<rt>셓ˆ</rt></ruby>’래 <ruby>踅<rt>셓ˆ</rt></ruby>’킈 <ruby title=\"khia\">騎<rt>캬-</rt></ruby><ruby>꾼<rt>ˎ</rt></ru